WEBVTT

1
00:00:02,510 --> 00:00:04,510
I don't want it, I can be alone

2
00:00:04,510 --> 00:00:06,510
As long as you don't join others, you still have a chance

3
00:00:06,510 --> 00:00:08,960
One person can do it

4
00:00:08,960 --> 00:00:10,960
I will help you with your practice

5
00:00:10,960 --> 00:00:12,960
I can do that too. If you have any questions, feel free to contact me.

6
00:00:12,960 --> 00:00:19,730
Wait until the control is strong

7
00:00:19,730 --> 00:00:22,530
I also want to learn to fly

8
00:00:22,530 --> 00:00:24,530
Aunt Wen Zhong just brought students into the job

9
00:00:24,530 --> 00:00:26,530
Zhang Qiuyue felt weird before she even left the cafeteria.

10
00:00:26,530 --> 00:00:28,530
The hundred names were told to her.

11
00:00:28,530 --> 00:00:30,530
I reported back every word of what I said to her.

12
00:00:30,530 --> 00:00:34,220
Let Zhang Qiuyue and Huang Xuyang come to my office

13
00:00:34,220 --> 00:00:36,220
It's my wife's complaint

14
00:00:36,220 --> 00:00:38,220
What can you do

15
00:00:38,220 --> 00:00:41,310
Since it feels unfair

16
00:00:41,310 --> 00:00:43,310
I can transfer you to Nanjing or the Western District

17
00:00:43,310 --> 00:00:45,310
No, I won't go

18
00:00:45,310 --> 00:00:47,310
I came earlier than her

19
00:00:47,310 --> 00:00:50,820
But he can't even do a single move in this kind of battle.

20
00:00:50,820 --> 00:00:52,820
If you don't go, be honest.

21
00:00:52,820 --> 00:00:54,820
Report criticism internally and deduct three months' salary

22
00:00:54,820 --> 00:00:56,820
Slander colleagues again

23
00:00:56,820 --> 00:00:58,820
Pack your things and get out
